name 'csp_unit1_lesson10_cfu1_dev_27_28'
title 'Multiple Choice: Bits to Pixels'
description ''
question 'A pixel in a color image uses 6 bits. Which statement describes how those bits make the color of the pixel?'
wrong 'Each bit picks one color from a list of six colors.'
right 'The bits are split into three groups, and each group sets the level of red, green, or blue light.'
wrong 'The bits are added together to get one brightness number.'
wrong 'The bits store the position of the pixel in the image.'
allow_multiple_attempts true